WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:10,020
After sleeping for two days, I finally woke up and drank.

2
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:13,680
life-threatening medicine

3
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:14,680
Thank you, senior sister

4
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:22,380
The elder's medicine is still so powerful.

5
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:23,380
How's the deal?

6
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:26,610
The matter was interrupted due to Bai Zu Wushu's incident.

7
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:28,610
Sect Leader Dai is discussing with the elders

8
00:00:28,610 --> 00:00:30,610
Wang Zhi was run over by Shouchao and was seriously injured.

9
00:00:30,610 --> 00:00:32,610
Although I don't know why

10
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:35,610
But you were found in the back mountain of the sect.

11
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:38,830
How come the underground of the secret realm is connected to the back mountain of the sect?

12
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:39,830
You are here too

13
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:42,270
do you know

14
00:00:42,270 --> 00:00:43,270
Your child

15
00:00:43,270 --> 00:00:46,270
You almost trapped me to death underneath.

16
00:00:46,270 --> 00:00:50,350
Disadvantage: Just lie down for two days if there is any movement

17
00:00:50,350 --> 00:00:52,350
How can you break in with me in the future?

18
00:00:52,350 --> 00:00:54,350
The disciples can be safe and sound

19
00:00:54,350 --> 00:00:55,450
I have worked hard these past two days.

20
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:56,450
What is your name, elder?

21
00:00:56,450 --> 00:00:58,450
Still haven't changed your tune?
